  "body": "## What's changed\n\n- On the home screen, the row that reads a whole directory is now called `open all (…)` instead of taking the directory's name, and a directory that holds only other directories no longer offers one\n- Opening a directory whose files are of different kinds now says so in plain words and suggests what to open instead\n"
